Package: ppict
Type: Package
Title: Prediction-Powered Inference with a Group-Lasso Prognostic Score
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Anurag", "Nepal", email = "noreply@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Anurag Nepal [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Anurag Nepal <noreply@example.com>
Description: A local R port of the Python ppict package. It implements the
    permutation-assisted group-lasso selector, the prognostic score, the
    shared-tuning PPI++ treatment-effect estimator and interval, and a
    dataset-in, estimate-and-interval-out analysis entry point. The port is
    checked numerically against the Python package on shared fixtures. The
    simulation sweep and the calculator are not part of this package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
